# Kept on disk, deliberately never committed.
#
# The handoff is the working record of this project: what is half-built, which
# credentials have been mishandled, what is known to be weak and has not been
# fixed yet. That is exactly what a maintainer needs and exactly what should
# not be sitting in a repository's history, where deleting it later does not
# remove it.
docs/PROJECT_HANDOFF.md
